          "id": "348723c1-1aa0-4a7e-af2c-bad0e30cf09a",
          "title": "Warrants",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "a7d5a17c-74bf-481b-87e1-a0b52c1bf926",
              "content": "<p><strong>Issues:</strong> Integration Ticket entered for issues below</p><ul><li>A warrant did not reactivate despite having the same docket number and subject. Still investigating.</li></ul>"
            },
            {
              "id": "d0fb9095-2772-4a6d-991a-7b5166f27dd3",
              "content": "<p>Certain charges coming in incorrectly.</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "5ae2eb07-96c6-4b43-8b10-9a1013e953fc",
              "content": "<p>This is partly due to the payload. The payload has the charge id and part of the charge description. It does not include the severity.</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "115cad19-fe34-46fc-b4ad-634e591597c9",
              "content": "<p>The integration picks an active charge on the MCT with the closet match to what is in the payload. Continuing to investigate.</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "84977b9c-c705-4867-b8ec-b0f44392072c",
              "content": "<p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Records specialist updates warrant to correct charge</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
